OL,3,GNEWSAWoman charged in suspected murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been charged with
OL,7,Fwithholding information in the
OL,8,Finvestigation into the suspected murder
OL,9,Fof Carrie Mullane.
OL,11,FThe 39-year-old had been missing since
OL,12,Fshe arrived in Enniskillen from
OL,13,FLimerick on 10 October 2026.
OL,15,FOn Monday a body was recovered by
OL,16,Fpolice from Lough Erne in County
OL,17,FFermanagh.
OL,19,FThe woman, 69, will appear at Dungannon
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
